    "body": "Rerun the unchanged H200 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash GPU-KV AgentX recipe at concurrency 1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64, and 128. The exact changelog key selects H200 only.\n\n\u4f7f\u7528\u672a\u4fee\u6539\u7684 H200 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash GPU-KV AgentX \u914d\u65b9\u91cd\u65b0\u8fd0\u884c\u5e76\u53d1 1\u30012\u30014\u30018\u300116\u300132\u300164\u3001128\u3002\u7cbe\u786e changelog key \u4ec5\u9009\u62e9 H200\u3002\n\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Low Risk**\n> Changelog-only change that triggers a perf rerun; no runtime, auth, or recipe logic is altered.\n> \n> **Overview**\n> Adds a **perf-changelog** entry for `dsv41flash-fp4-h200-vllm-agentic-dspark` so CI can rerun the existing H200 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash GPU-KV AgentX sweep. The recipe is unchanged (TP8, full trace, 1M context, DSpark5 AL 3.51); only concurrency levels **1\u2013128** (1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64, 128) are exercised again under the agentic-coding scenario.\n> \n> No benchmark scripts, master config, or launcher logic are modified in this PR\u2014the diff is the changelog row plus bilingual descriptions and PR **3077** link.\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 58b220cf878f3414fa114510386d02d348395121. Bugbot is set up for automated code reviews on this repo. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->",
